,"status":1,"index":0,"m3u8Path":"https:\u002F\u002Fv3.goodshort.com\u002Fmts\u002Fbooks\u002F670\u002F31001424670\u002F791272\u002Fnjzvsusdr0\u002Forigin1\u002Fl7hpjk2rc7.m3u8?expiredTime=1788282362&tul=f41adda396ecd31f9744ccfed275325987f9b39d81fdc98e086210935bd4477e1c99dda091276fa3122d4b62c8f302a194c8d3b1fced655229a94ad7f503030e","image":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F31001424670\u002F202606\u002Fcover-POghHry3QT.jpg","praiseCount":16707,"type":0,"playTime":168,"publishTime":"2026-06-15 22:19:39","ctime":"2026-06-15 22:19:39","seoChapterName":"001","chapterResourceUrl":"001-42779796"},"guessLike":[{"bookId":"31001679096","bookName":"The Don’s Favorite Lover Vanished 3","pseudonym":"QQ","cover":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202608\u002Fcover-gvjyfC8dvL.jpg","cover2":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fhttps:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202608\u002F9cd1fdb42885bc9368fababc9a96c003a1dc68c6e495357eb52fcc70aa1e9847053b8338eba5d54b1371e8e620c9b2f9.jpg","bookCoverId":0,"viewCount":416,"ratings":0,"introduction":"I’m the best art forger and intel specialist in Chicago. And I fell for the man who owned it all, Don Vincenzo Russo. For ten years, I was his secret, his weapon, and his woman. I built his empire from the shadows. I thought I’d get a ring. After all, every night he was in this city, he was buried inside me, taking his pleasure. He’d whisper that I was his, that no one else felt this good. But this time, after he was finished with me, he announced he was marrying the Russian Bratva princess, Katerina Petrov. That’s when I knew. I wasn’t his woman. I was just a body. For an alliance, for her, he sacrificed me. He left me to die. So I destroyed every piece of the life he gave me. I made one call to my father in Italy. And then, I vanished. But when the Don who owned Chicago couldn't find his favorite toy… he went insane.","commentCount":0,"followCount":0,"likeCount":0,"praiseCount":0,"chapterCount":58,"totalWords":4770,"lastChapterId":62508492,"lastChapterTime":"2026-08-15 21:17:07","lastChapterName":"058","writeStatus":"COMPLETE","typeTwoNames":["Romance"],"grade":"PLUS4","period":"CONTEMPORARY","status":"PUBLISHED","novelType":"ORIGINAL","bookType":5,"language":"ENGLISH","free":2,"contractStatus":"SIGNED","unit":"CHAPTER","genderType":2,"likeNum":0,"previewChapterNum":0,"seoBookName":"The Don’s Favorite Lover Vanished 3","supportHorizontal":0,"tagsList":[{"id":547,"name":"Mafia","resourceUrl":"mafia-playlets-videos"},{"id":515,"name":"Toxic Love","resourceUrl":"toxic-love-playlets-videos"},{"id":524,"name":"Dark Romance","resourceUrl":"dark-romance-playlets-videos"},{"id":592,"name":"Contract Marriage","resourceUrl":"contract-marriage-playlets-videos"},{"id":609,"name":"Hate-love","resourceUrl":"hate-love-playlets-videos"}],"genreList":[{"id":137,"name":"Romance","resourceUrl":"romance-137-playlets"}],"read":false,"inLibrary":false,"bookResourceUrl":"the-don-s-favorite-lover-vanished-3-31001679096","viewCountDisplay":"1.3K","writeStatusDisplay":"Completed","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"},{"bookId":"31001675096","bookName":"Kiss My Corpse 2","pseudonym":"QQ","cover":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202608\u002Fcover-QIn5ALzNtS.jpg","cover2":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fhttps:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202608\u002F293b3269296f2c5085c5af8173bc9d7aa8a7f7f6ad5c467d94d242bed7252a4e12dd20b1e4fae0ef413fde1bf57f05dc.jpg","bookCoverId":0,"viewCount":431,"ratings":0,"introduction":"Just because I forget to bring my mate's lover back—leaving her alone in the wilderness for three hours—he flies into a rage and throws me into an abandoned well in the desolate countryside. \"You need to experience the torment that Belinda was put through.\" The well is deep and narrow, forcing me to curl up in my wolf form. I struggle to breathe. I plead for mercy and beg for forgiveness. However, all he does is tell me off icily. \"Stay there and repent for your sins. You'll only understand the dignity required of a Luna once you learn your lesson from this.\" He orders his men to seal the well with a large boulder. I let out anguished howls and roars as I claw my way upward. However, I only fall back down over and over again. The walls of the well are covered in my claw marks. I continue like this until I can't make a sound through my parched throat. … Half a month later, my mate's heart softens when he sees the birthday gift I've prepared in advance for him. He decides to end my punishment. Unbeknownst to him, worms and snakes have already gnawed my body beyond recognition at the bottom of the well.","commentCount":0,"followCount":0,"likeCount":0,"praiseCount":0,"chapterCount":33,"totalWords":2711,"lastChapterId":62590139,"lastChapterTime":"2026-08-16 19:30:31","lastChapterName":"033","writeStatus":"COMPLETE","typeTwoNames":["Romance"],"grade":"PLUS4","period":"CONTEMPORARY","status":"PUBLISHED","novelType":"ORIGINAL","bookType":5,"language":"ENGLISH","free":2,"contractStatus":"SIGNED","unit":"CHAPTER","genderType":2,"likeNum":0,"previewChapterNum":0,"seoBookName":"Kiss My Corpse 2","supportHorizontal":0,"tagsList":[{"id":544,"name":"Luna","resourceUrl":"luna-playlets-videos"},{"id":515,"name":"Toxic Love","resourceUrl":"toxic-love-playlets-videos"},{"id":628,"name":"Regret","resourceUrl":"regret-playlets-videos"},{"id":593,"name":"Betrayal","resourceUrl":"betrayal-playlets-videos"},{"id":590,"name":"Love Triangle","resourceUrl":"love-triangle-playlets-videos"}],"genreList":[{"id":137,"name":"Romance","resourceUrl":"romance-137-playlets"}],"read":false,"inLibrary":false,"bookResourceUrl":"kiss-my-corpse-2-31001675096","viewCountDisplay":"1.3K","writeStatusDisplay":"Completed","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"},{"bookId":"31001679069","bookName":"I Gave My Luna Title to My Sister, Now She Regrets It","pseudonym":"QQ","cover":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202608\u002Fcover-EDocW6SPgr.jpg","cover2":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fhttps:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202608\u002Fde1ddedd7cfddfe91c46140db70f441247676ed5ae844b60f36c199ff4a2c3224a44a3678f6af11a96fa562ef5164e78.jpg","bookCoverId":0,"viewCount":604,"ratings":0,"introduction":"The moment our yacht capsized, my childhood friend, Eric, tightly gripped my hand. But I shoved him toward my sister, Lily, and let myself sink into the freezing ocean. In my past life, Eric chose to save me. Lily drowned, her body lost to the sea forever. Though Eric mated with me, he hid a bitter resentment behind a mask of indifference, subjecting me to endless torment. “If it weren’t for you, Lily wouldn’t have died!” he would sneer. Broken by his cruelty, I spiraled into severe depression and died. When I opened my eyes again, I was back on that sinking yacht. Without hesitation, I gave the chance of survival to Lily, stepping aside to let them be together. But I didn’t die. At death’s door, I was rescued by Jason, the most powerful True Alpha of the Northern Packs. I chose him to be my fated mate, and together, we built a life and raised our pup. Three years later, I accompanied Jason to the Alpha Summit. When an urgent boundary dispute called Jason away, he arranged for the local pack to pick me up at the harbor. To my shock, the wolf waiting for me was Eric—someone I hadn’t seen in three years. His eyes lit up with sudden fervor the moment he saw me. “I knew you weren’t dead!” Then, his gaze turned arrogant. “Though Lily and I are already mated, I don’t mind taking you back to the pack. For old times’ sake, I can make you my mistress.”","commentCount":0,"followCount":0,"likeCount":0,"praiseCount":0,"chapterCount":35,"totalWords":2110,"lastChapterId":62418244,"lastChapterTime":"2026-08-14 21:12:57","lastChapterName":"035","writeStatus":"COMPLETE","typeTwoNames":["Urban"],"grade":"PLUS4","period":"CONTEMPORARY","status":"PUBLISHED","novelType":"ORIGINAL","bookType":5,"language":"ENGLISH","free":2,"contractStatus":"SIGNED","unit":"CHAPTER","genderType":2,"likeNum":0,"previewChapterNum":0,"seoBookName":"I Gave My Luna Title to My Sister, Now She Regrets It","supportHorizontal":0,"tagsList":[{"id":523,"name":"Reborn","resourceUrl":"reborn-playlets-videos"},{"id":515,"name":"Toxic Love","resourceUrl":"toxic-love-playlets-videos"},{"id":548,"name":"Werewolf","resourceUrl":"werewolf-playlets-videos"},{"id":544,"name":"Luna","resourceUrl":"luna-playlets-videos"},{"id":591,"name":"Counterattack","resourceUrl":"counterattack-playlets-videos"}],"genreList":[{"id":136,"name":"Urban","resourceUrl":"urban-136-playlets"}],"read":false,"inLibrary":false,"bookResourceUrl":"i-gave-my-luna-title-to-my-sister-now-she-regrets-it-31001679069","viewCountDisplay":"1.8K","writeStatusDisplay":"Completed","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"},{"bookId":"31001677510","bookName":"Marrying the Mafia King 2","pseudonym":"TXH","cover":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202608\u002Fcover-sM0l5ztQ5U.jpg","cover2":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fhttps:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202608\u002Ff98d427b6c60497e917fdfa2c2b6b80dd9cd7cb6b82f0998d3aae5a66f4749983fc11253372587c9c9594e102f2aee3e.jpg","bookCoverId":0,"viewCount":409,"ratings":0,"introduction":"During our decade together, I stay by Felix Valentino's side as he slowly ascends to the peak of the mafia world. I become the woman he trusts most. However, he secretly names an island that we fought for and won together after my best friend, Lilian Fenati. Why? Because Lilian is terminally ill. Her dying wish is to marry Felix on the island named after her. Felix clamps down on this and forbids anyone from telling me. He has no idea Lilian live streams the whole thing for me. That night, I cry my heart out. Meanwhile, Felix spends the night with Lilian. I lie in a pool of blood. My heart condition acts up, and my breathing starts to slow. Where is Felix? At the hospital with Lilian. Five days later, I accept a marriage proposal from Harold Bonanno, the mafia king.","commentCount":0,"followCount":0,"likeCount":0,"praiseCount":0,"chapterCount":33,"totalWords":3500,"lastChapterId":62418850,"lastChapterTime":"2026-08-14 21:33:37","lastChapterName":"033","writeStatus":"COMPLETE","typeTwoNames":["Romance"],"grade":"PLUS4","period":"CONTEMPORARY","status":"PUBLISHED","novelType":"ORIGINAL","bookType":5,"language":"ENGLISH","free":2,"contractStatus":"SIGNED","unit":"CHAPTER","genderType":2,"likeNum":0,"previewChapterNum":0,"seoBookName":"Marrying the Mafia King 2","supportHorizontal":0,"tagsList":[{"id":515,"name":"Toxic Love","resourceUrl":"toxic-love-playlets-videos"},{"id":517,"name":"Marriage","resourceUrl":"marriage-playlets-videos"},{"id":547,"name":"Mafia","resourceUrl":"mafia-playlets-videos"},{"id":628,"name":"Regret","resourceUrl":"regret-playlets-videos"},{"id":619,"name":"Getting Back at Ex","resourceUrl":"getting-back-at-ex-playlets-videos"}],"genreList":[{"id":137,"name":"Romance","resourceUrl":"romance-137-playlets"}],"read":false,"inLibrary":false,"bookResourceUrl":"marrying-the-mafia-king-2-31001677510","viewCountDisplay":"1.2K","writeStatusDisplay":"Completed","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"},{"bookId":"31001689022","bookName":"The Deaf Bride Isn't Deaf","pseudonym":"QQ","cover":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202608\u002Fcover-FsNX0r2x4A.jpg","cover2":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fhttps:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202608\u002F274af576770904a1e3bea8ff1420cc74d292d750cafe96fdefa2a21762c3c95cc9c793840f7c6673ca5360a6f50557f3.jpg","bookCoverId":0,"viewCount":117,"ratings":0,"introduction":"Miss Hudson, we have prepared a corpse identical to you, just as you requested. It will be delivered to your wedding with Mr. Warhol in ten days.\" Hearing the voice on the other end of the line, Violet Hudson felt a small knot of tension unwind inside her. \"Alright. Thank you.\" \"You're welcome. This is our job. Please rest assured—no one will ever suspect a thing.\" With that guarantee, she exhaled, the weight on her chest easing just a little. After confirming the final details once more, she ended the call and pushed open the door to the private room. The noise inside had been a constant hum, a mix of voices overlapping, but the moment she stepped in, silence fell like a curtain.","commentCount":0,"followCount":0,"likeCount":0,"praiseCount":0,"chapterCount":66,"totalWords":5045,"lastChapterId":62647903,"lastChapterTime":"2026-08-17 11:20:26","lastChapterName":"066","writeStatus":"COMPLETE","typeTwoNames":["Romance"],"grade":"PLUS4","period":"CONTEMPORARY","status":"PUBLISHED","novelType":"ORIGINAL","bookType":5,"language":"ENGLISH","free":2,"contractStatus":"SIGNED","unit":"CHAPTER","genderType":2,"likeNum":0,"previewChapterNum":0,"seoBookName":"The Deaf Bride Isn't Deaf","supportHorizontal":0,"tagsList":[{"id":515,"name":"Toxic Love","resourceUrl":"toxic-love-playlets-videos"},{"id":616,"name":"Chasing Love","resourceUrl":"chasing-love-playlets-videos"},{"id":628,"name":"Regret","resourceUrl":"regret-playlets-videos"},{"id":540,"name":"CEO","resourceUrl":"ceo-playlets-videos"},{"id":554,"name":"Strong Female Lead","resourceUrl":"strong-female-lead-playlets-videos"}],"genreList":[{"id":137,"name":"Romance","resourceUrl":"romance-137-playlets"}],"read":false,"inLibrary":false,"bookResourceUrl":"the-deaf-bride-isn-t-deaf-31001689022","viewCountDisplay":"367","writeStatusDisplay":"Completed","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"},{"bookId":"31001679163","bookName":"His Vampire Heart Never Beat For Me","pseudonym":"79","cover":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202608\u002Fcover-JRaSsBxHLJ.png","cover2":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fhttps:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202608\u002F11a3d06ef694bf327a3951badec641f89962c4dd47f5ff919ade9588f7ecd6581f77f9d95f25c84e76a61021fa409634.png","bookCoverId":0,"viewCount":507,"ratings":0,"introduction":"Seraphina once believed she was the vampire prince Alistair's one true love. Five years ago, he rescued her and declared her his soulmate. But when she was attacked by werewolves while pregnant, he sent all the healers to her stepsister Isabella, who had forged a \"life bond\" with him, causing her to miscarry. Over five years, he favored Isabella—stealing Seraphina's paintings, giving her the studio key, and planting flowers that Seraphina was allergic to. After the truth came out, she faked her death and escaped under the alias Phoebe Miller. She later became an art restorer, was discovered by gallery owner Julian, and rebuilt her life independently. Isabella died in prison, and Alistair, consumed by regret, became an arbiter. A year later, her Light and Shadow series succeeded, and holding Julian's hand, she finally found a peaceful life.","commentCount":0,"followCount":0,"likeCount":0,"praiseCount":0,"chapterCount":58,"totalWords":3093,"lastChapterId":62160316,"lastChapterTime":"2026-08-12 15:55:56","lastChapterName":"058","writeStatus":"COMPLETE","typeTwoNames":["Fantasy"],"grade":"PLUS4","period":"CONTEMPORARY","status":"PUBLISHED","novelType":"ORIGINAL","bookType":5,"language":"ENGLISH","free":2,"contractStatus":"SIGNED","unit":"CHAPTER","genderType":2,"likeNum":0,"previewChapterNum":0,"seoBookName":"His Vampire Heart Never Beat For Me","supportHorizontal":0,"tagsList":[{"id":515,"name":"Toxic Love","resourceUrl":"toxic-love-playlets-videos"},{"id":526,"name":"Second Chance","resourceUrl":"second-chance-playlets-videos"},{"id":552,"name":"Vampire","resourceUrl":"vampire-playlets-videos"},{"id":593,"name":"Betrayal","resourceUrl":"betrayal-playlets-videos"},{"id":628,"name":"Regret","resourceUrl":"regret-playlets-videos"}],"genreList":[{"id":135,"name":"Fantasy","resourceUrl":"fantasy-135-playlets"}],"read":false,"inLibrary":false,"bookResourceUrl":"his-vampire-heart-never-beat-for-me-31001679163","viewCountDisplay":"1.5K","writeStatusDisplay":"Completed","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"}],"seoResourcesList":[],"recommends":[{"bookId":"31000652200","bookName":"The Canary of the Mafia Boss","pseudonym":"owen","cover":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202507\u002Fcover-zdqGDfOXGx.jpg","cover2":"https:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fhttps:\u002F\u002Facf.goodshort.com\u002Fvideobook\u002F202507\u002Fc0dc48d36b3f19a8b76fd5f49e334cc7aee40f13279385dc20cd9f26f01c8a1fb816208e1a6413ed877f9644a4188af5.jpg","bookCoverId":0,"viewCount":1067867,"ratings":0,"introduction":"Valentina, an American girl who just graduated from college, thought she could start a new chapter in her life, but she didn't expect to find disaster for the whole family because of her brother's gambling debts. They have offended the mafia Romano family. In order to prevent her brother from being killed by the mob, Valentina has to agree to marry Alessandro, the head of the Romano family. After a dramatic wedding, Valentina is placed in Romano's mansion as a \"canary\", but she is always looking for a chance to escape. After receiving a death threat, a terrified Valentina makes a secret escape plan with the help of Alessandro's cousin, but even she doesn't realize that she's fallen in love with Alessandro.","commentCount":0,"followCount":0,"likeCount":0,"praiseCount":0,"chapterCount":55,"totalWords":3360,"lastChapterId":6741474,"lastChapterTime":"2025-08-09 00:48:08","lastChapterName":"055","writeStatus":"COMPLETE","typeOneIds":[37],"typeTwoIds":[286],"typeOneNames":["英文-女"],"typeTwoNames":["Romance"],"grade":"PLUS4","period":"CONTEMPORARY","status":"PUBLISHED","novelType":"ORIGINAL","bookType":5,"language":"ENGLISH","free":2,"contractStatus":"SIGNED","unit":"CHAPTER","genderType":2,"likeNum":0,"previewChapterNum":0,"seoBookName":"The Agreement","supportHorizontal":0,"tagsList":[{"id":528,"name":"Twisted","resourceUrl":"twisted-playlets-videos"},